{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wlaH8rgdGz1794605779.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>意大利北部暴雨成災，19人被困河道旁的鐵道橋底，最終獲救。</p><p></p><p>意大利憲兵及救援人員，周五利用繩索等工具，將所有被困的人救起。意大利北部沿海市鎮文蒂米利亞連日下暴雨，導致魯瓦亞河水位暴漲，當時有十幾人，包括在鐵路橋底露宿的移民，趕不及逃離現場，一度被困在橋底。在營救被困人士期間，相關鐵路暫時停駛。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T22:28:55.896081+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T17:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:14.544721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T22:22:06.292621+00:00","content_hash":"711cc9d0061b6f08752c1d287b6c8fca25915c57b5c1b2c10748861ffe5dd2d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T22:28:55.896081+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}